      "title": "Careers",
      "description": "Careers - Warner University Skip to content Menu Apply Visit Request Info Give Menu Apply Visit Request Info Give Menu Menu Apply Visit Request Info Give Menu Careers Explore Our Benefits Interested in a career at Warner University? Here is a look at our competitive benefits package for full-time employees! Generous Paid Time off starting in year one of employment Generous Paid Holiday Time off Eligible for Medical, Prescription, Dental & Vision Insurances (within 30 days of hire) 100% Employer-Paid Short & Long Term Disability Insurance and Life Insurance Policy Up to 9% of Pay in Retirement Contributions from Warner University for Full-Time Faculty and Staff Discounted On-Campus Dining Meal Plans Free On-Campus Parking Paid tuition benefits for Employees, Spouses and Qualified Dependents Participation in tuition exchange programs from the CCCU, CIC and Tuition Exchange, Inc Free Full Tuition for Employees and Qualified Dependents Flexible spending accounts for health and dependent care Award-Winning Wellbeing Programs: Strive Dollars, Hinge Health Musculoskeletal Coaching, Surgery Plus Free Elective Surgery, Virta Type 2 Diabetes Reversal and more! Ready to Join the Team? We’d love to get to know you! Take a look at our current job postings with the link below. Our Current Job Postings Are you a current employee? Log into your benefits portal below. Employee Benefits Portal Human Resources Lake Wales, Florida (863) 638-1426 Info For Newly Admitted Students Current Students Parents & Families Faculty & Staff Friends of Warner Alumni Helpful Links Maps & Directions Commencement Offices & Services Directory EASE Grant Performance Measures Careers News Events Library Royal Cup Apply Visit Request Info Give Quality Enhancement Plan Title IX Privacy Policy Media Inquiries Website Feedback Report A Broken Link Nondiscrimination Policy Warner University admits students of any race, color, national and ethnic origin to all the rights, privileges, programs, and activities generally accorded or made available to students at the school. It does not discriminate on the basis of race, color, national and ethnic origin in administration of its educational policies, admissions policies, scholarship and loan programs, and athletic and other school-administered programs. © Copyright 2024 Warner University. All Rights Reserved . Close Academics Admissions & Aid Student Life Athletics About Search Search Info For Newly Admitted Students Current Students Parents & Families Faculty & Staff Friends of Warner Alumni Helpful Links News Events Bookstore Library Royal Cup Directory Offices & Services Academic Calendar"
